// Weight — exact item weights.
//
// Anything listed here overrides the weight this mod would compute on its own,
// for items carried, items stored in containers, and armor worn.
// Values are in Sable block-mass units: 1.0 = one stone block, a player = 0.75.
//
//   "namespace:item"  an exact item
//   "#namespace:tag"  every item in a tag (an exact item id wins over a tag)
//
// Empty by default: without entries the mod uses baseItemWeight and the
// #weight:light_item / #weight:heavy_item tags for carried items, and armor
// points for worn armor.
//
// Reload after editing with:  /weight reload
